        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "# Loyalty Points Investigation",
          "This optional notebook accompanies the hospitality workshop's booking-abuse graph lab. It preserves the PGX algorithm exercises using transferable hotel loyalty points. It is not the SQL/PGQ booking-evidence graph.",
          "Prerequisites: a PGQL property graph named LOYALTY_GRAPH over LOYALTY_MEMBERS and LOYALTY_POINT_TRANSFERS, the TRANSFERS edge label, the MEMBER_ID vertex property, and access to the in-memory PGX server. The Phase 2 loader must create these objects before this notebook can run.",
          "Members 534, 597, 934, 387, and 406 are synthetic fixture IDs. Outputs have been cleared. Run every paragraph in sequence to produce results; rankings, paths, and counts depend on the loaded graph."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
