        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "First, load the graph into the in-memory graph server if it still needs to be loaded since we will execute some graph algorithms.",
          "",
          "Run the first %python-pgx paragraph, which uses the built-in session object to read the graph into memory from the database and creates a PgXGraph object that handles the loaded graph."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
